{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4f0c7a2-6f1b-4a3e-9c2d-driwinhito2001",
    "name": "DriWin Hito 2 — API REST /api/v1",
    "description": "Colección oficial de pruebas del Back-End DriWin (Hito 2). Cubre health, CRUD completo de hardware-components, CRUD de driver-packages, CRUD de bloatware-rules, los endpoints de negocio recommendations/driver y recommendations/apps, y los casos de error del contrato (400/401/403/404/409/422).\n\nAntes de ejecutar:\n1. Levantar la API: cd server-api && npm run dev\n2. Ejecutar db/init.sql sobre driwin_catalog\n3. Configurar las variables de colección: baseUrl, apiKey (rol read-write) y readOnlyKey (opcional)\n4. Ejecutar la carpeta en orden: Health → Hardware CRUD → Driver CRUD → Bloatware CRUD → Recommendations → Errores.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "REEMPLAZAR_API_KEY_READ_WRITE" },
    { "key": "readOnlyKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "componentId", "value": "5" },
    { "key": "driverId", "value": "13" },
    { "key": "bloatwareId", "value": "4" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 · Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET health (sonda de vida)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "Pública. Verifica que el pool responda SELECT 1 y mide la latencia."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Base de datos arriba', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.database).to.eql('up');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.version).to.match(/^\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+$/);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Hardware CRUD (recurso 1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST crear hardware (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ven_id\": \"8086\",\n  \"dev_id\": \"9A49\",\n  \"subsys_id\": \"GENERIC\",\n  \"commercial_name\": \"Intel Iris Xe Graphics (Tiger Lake-LP GT2)\",\n  \"category\": \"GPU\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hardware-components", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["hardware-components"] },
            "description": "Crea un componente único (8086/9A49) para no chocar con la semilla."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Cabecera Location presente', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Envoltorio { data }', () => pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('object'));",
                  "pm.test('Firma normalizada', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.ven_id).to.eql('8086');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.dev_id).to.eql('9A49');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('componentId', body.data.component_id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET listar hardware (200 + meta)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hardware-components?ven_id=8086&dev_id=9A49&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["hardware-components"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "ven_id", "value": "8086" },
                { "key": "dev_id", "value": "9A49" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Envoltorio { data, meta }', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.meta).to.have.property('totalPages');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('El registro creado está persistido', () => pm.expect(body.data.length).to.be.at.least(1));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
